{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261118%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官李志豪<br/>休班水警與妻涉紀律部隊宿舍內襲擊外傭｜答辯</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 1430　4庭　裁判官王證瑜<br/>中學副校涉車上非禮女學生｜裁決<br/>► 1430　8庭　裁判官林子康<br/>芬蘭愛沙尼亞海底管道電纜損壞　港貨輪船長被控刑毀及票控兩罪｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　14庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>電機工程師涉襲妻女｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸觀塘法院<br/>► 0930　8庭　裁判官劉淑嫻<br/>公務員涉扶手電梯偷拍裙底事主｜續審</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:15:08.377698+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":383,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T14:03:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T23:35:45.320456+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:28.633439+00:00","content_hash":"6019a29b146a3a3128f30187f714174528c098d5390346c2c8ea2e0b08193c19","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}